<!--
  Mapping between geocat.ch and opendata.swiss organizations
  
  Format:
  - geocatName: Organization name in geocat (typically in German, but depends on metadata default language)
  - opendataSlug: Exact slug used by opendata.swiss (from /api/3/action/organization_list)
  
  To add a new organization:
  1. Find the organization name in geocat: https://geocat.ch/geonetwork/srv/api/groups
     Note: The name language depends on the metadata's default locale (usually German)
  2. Find the corresponding slug on opendata.swiss: https://ckan.opendata.swiss/api/3/action/organization_list
  3. Add an <org> entry
  
  Sources:
  - geocat: https://geocat-dev.dev.bgdi.ch/geonetwork/srv/api/groups
  - opendata.swiss: https://ckan.ogdch-abnahme.clients.liip.ch/api/3/action/organization_list
  
  Last updated: 2026-02-02
-->
